MJneth...@gmail.com wrote:

> Might someone please someone help me understand
> how to get gifts from my god?

It takes _lots_ of sacrifices to get artifacts, and
since you'll presumably be killing monsters to
sacrifice them, you experience level will rise
steadily as you do, and, due to the game mechanics,
the level of monsters generated will rise with your
experience level, even if you stay on the same
dungeon level. If you can avoid starving, by eating
a good portion of the monsters you kill rather than
sacrificing them, mere patience should eventually
produce artifacts for you.

Do avoid praying while sacrificing, if artifacts are
your goal. Prayers (with prayer gifts) and artifacts
are fairly much a "one or the other" way to use the
benefits resulting from your sacrifices.

